name=Find Your Dead Self
id=PZFindYourDeadSelf
author=kaleido4
modversion=1.0.0
versionMin=42.0.0
description=Shows where you died on the world map, so you can find your body with your next character. <LINE>
description=A red skull with the character's name marks the spot. If the body reanimates, the skull follows your zombie while it is in a loaded area, and stays at its last known position while it is not. When your zombie is killed, the skull stays where it fell. <LINE>
description=The skull disappears when the game would remove the corpse (Hours for Corpse Removal sandbox option). <LINE>
description=Also makes sure a death always leaves a corpse, even when god mode is turned on while already dying. <LINE>
description= <LINE>
description=<H2>Sandbox options <LINE>
description=<TEXT>* Death Marker Visibility: Only me, Me + faction or Everyone (multiplayer only). <LINE>
description=* Always Leave a Body: on by default. <LINE>
description= <LINE>
description=Made for SP and MP. MP was not tested yet. <LINE>
description=Can be added to existing saves. Only deaths after installing get a skull.
